.TH GNOCROMICON 1 "" "gnocromicon @VERSION@"
.SH NAME
gnocromicon \- identify and catalog tabletop role-playing books
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B gnocromicon
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B gnocromicon
is a GTK application to identify and catalog tabletop role-playing books.
.PP
It opens the graphical interface. Standard GTK and GApplication options are accepted;
the application has no commands of its own.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/gnocromicon/settings.json
User settings (language and theme).
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B LANGUAGE
Interface language when the language setting is "System".
